              <div class="exp-sidebar-role">Observability Engineer</div>
              <div class="exp-sidebar-co">Thoughtroutes · Clients</div>
            </div>
            <div class="exp-sidebar-item" data-exp="xmig" id="esb-xmig">
              <div class="exp-sidebar-year">Jun 2023 — Nov 2023</div>
              <div class="exp-sidebar-role">Full-Stack Developer</div>
              <div class="exp-sidebar-co">Xmigrate</div>
            </div>
            <div class="exp-sidebar-item" data-exp="intern" id="esb-intern">
              <div class="exp-sidebar-year">May 2023 — Jun 2023</div>
              <div class="exp-sidebar-role">Web Developer Intern</div>
              <div class="exp-sidebar-co">Xmigrate</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="exp-main-wrap">
            <div class="exp-detail active" id="exp-adfolks">
              <p class="exp-detail-quote">"Built and deployed the official CDA platform (dcsl.cda.gov.ae) that earned a Guinness World Record for highest online member participation."</p>
              <div class="exp-detail-header">
                <div class="exp-detail-role">Full-Stack Developer (Contract)</div>
                <div class="exp-detail-meta">
                  <span class="exp-detail-co">Thoughtroutes · CDA, Dubai Government</span>
                  <span class="exp-detail-date">Dec 2025</span>
                  <span class="exp-detail-type">Remote · Contract</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <ul class="exp-list">
                <li>Built and deployed the official CDA platform (<a href="https://dcsl.cda.gov.ae/en" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--ac)">dcsl.cda.gov.ae</a>) that earned a Guinness World Record for highest online member participation.</li>
                <li>Developed and Dockerised Next.js app with multi-stage builds for Azure; implemented full i18n (English/Arabic RTL), passwordless magic-link auth, and PostgreSQL schema with audit logging.</li>
              </ul>
              <div class="tech-badges">
                <span class="tech-badge">Next.js</span><span class="tech-badge">PostgreSQL</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">SendGrid</span><span class="tech-badge">reCAPTCHA</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">Azure</span><span class="tech-badge">Docker</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="exp-detail" id="exp-exotic">
              <p class="exp-detail-quote">“Sole developer for a full-stack warehouse management system, executing a full-stack migration across multiple phases.”</p>
              <div class="exp-detail-header">
                <div class="exp-detail-role">Contract Full-Stack Developer</div>
                <div class="exp-detail-meta">
                  <span class="exp-detail-co">Exotic Green — Austria</span>
                  <span class="exp-detail-date">2024</span>
                  <span class="exp-detail-type">Remote · Part-time Contract</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <ul class="exp-list">
                <li>Designed and built a full warehouse management system, executing a full-stack migration across multiple phases.</li>
                <li>Phase 1: Developed a FastAPI backend (SQLAlchemy, Alembic, JWT) with AWS Cognito, and a Next.js frontend using NextAuth v5 (beta) and Google Sign-On.</li>
                <li>Phase 2: Added webcam barcode scanning integration via ZXing-JS, Zod schema validation, and redesigned UI with React & shadcn.</li>
                <li>Frappe Migration: Led transition of the entire codebase to the Frappe framework, deploying with Neon DB (Serverless Postgres), Redis, Nginx, and Frappe's native cookie-based authentication.</li>
              </ul>
              <div class="tech-badges">
                <span class="tech-badge">Frappe</span><span class="tech-badge">FastAPI</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">Next.js</span><span class="tech-badge">Neon DB</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">Redis</span><span class="tech-badge">AWS Cognito</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">Nginx</span><span class="tech-badge">Zod</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">ZXing-JS</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="exp-detail" id="exp-cp">
              <p class="exp-detail-quote">“Owned the entire backend of a multi-cloud cost governance SaaS — 20+ ingestion pipelines, secretless onboarding across AWS, GCP, and Azure, and an AI cost-estimation/prediction tool.”</p>
              <div class="exp-detail-header">
                <div class="exp-detail-role">Full-Stack Developer <span class="exp-now-badge">NOW</span></div>
                <div class="exp-detail-meta">
                  <span class="exp-detail-co">Thoughtroutes · CloudPositive</span>
                  <span class="exp-detail-date">Nov 2023 – Present</span>
                  <span class="exp-detail-type">Remote · Full-time</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <ul class="exp-list">
                <li>Architected multi-tenant FastAPI backend with dynamic per-tenant MySQL schema isolation and role-specific dashboards for finance, BU leader, and executive personas.</li>
                <li>Designed and built a data ingestion engine with 20+ modular pipelines covering AWS (Cost Explorer, Trusted Advisor, Compute Optimiser), GCP (BigQuery billing export), and Azure Cost Management, orchestrated via AWS SQS.</li>
                <li>Engineered secretless multi-cloud onboarding across all three clouds: AWS (IAM roles, no stored credentials), GCP (service account BigQuery billing export with minimal IAM), and Azure (multi-tenant app registration with admin consent flow — generates a service principal in the client tenant, used in an ARM template to provision necessary resources for cost data access).</li>
                <li>Built multi-cloud account validation service — AWS checks, GCP BigQuery, and Azure (RBAC, Cost Management, Blob) — deployed with Docker and Terraform.</li>
                <li>Developed real-time alerting module with OpenSearch monitors, configurable thresholds, and webhook notification channels.</li>
                <li>Implemented GCP pre-onboarding validator verifying BigQuery billing export access across projects; deployed on Kubernetes with Helm chart.</li>
                <li>Built proof-of-concept AI cost estimation API using OpenAI with structured JSON output and a multi-step pipeline (QueryParser → ParameterValidator → PromptEnhancer → OutputValidator).</li>
                <li>Deployed microservices on AWS ECS with RDS MySQL, SQS, and OpenSearch integration; authored provisioning scripts and Ansible playbooks.</li>
                <li>Managed server infrastructure (AWS EC2 & GCP Compute Engine) using Auto Scaling Groups, Grafana, Loki, and Prometheus.</li>
              </ul>
              <div class="tech-badges">
                <span class="tech-badge">FastAPI</span><span class="tech-badge">SQLAlchemy</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">AWS (ECS/RDS/Cognito/Lambda/SQS/Athena/OpenSearch)</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">GCP (BigQuery/IAM/GKE)</span><span class="tech-badge">Azure (Cost Mgmt/ARM)</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">MySQL</span><span class="tech-badge">Docker</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">Terraform</span><span class="tech-badge">Kubernetes/Helm</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">OpenAI</span><span class="tech-badge">Grafana/Loki/Prometheus</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="exp-detail" id="exp-infra">
              <p class="exp-detail-quote">"Managing end-to-end observability for multiple client environments — Prometheus alerting, Grafana dashboards, Loki log aggregation, and Beyla eBPF auto-instrumentation."</p>
              <div class="exp-detail-header">
                <div class="exp-detail-role">Infrastructure / Observability Engineer</div>
                <div class="exp-detail-meta">
                  <span class="exp-detail-co">Thoughtroutes · Client Deployments</span>
                  <span class="exp-detail-date">2024 – Present</span>
                  <span class="exp-detail-type">Remote · Full-time</span>
